description:
HIGH #3 from code review.

Current code mutates point.score directly which could affect cached results.

Change from:
```typescript
for (const point of searchResults) {
  point.score = point.score * boost; // MUTATION
}
```

To:
```typescript
searchResults = searchResults.map(point => ({
  ...point,
  score: point.score * boost,
}));
```

File: shared/qdrant/search.ts:165-173
